<title>NETHERLANDS: RESEARCH - Beter Bed started as outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH - Beter Bed started as outperform.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Jan 31 research.</p>
<p>Company-----Sector--------------Price---Broker-----</p>
<p>Beter Bed   Bedroom furnishings 31.00   NIBSecurities</p>
<p>COMMENT: Outperformer. Based on 15 pct underlying EPS growth and two pct dividend yield, current valuation 30 percent below peergroup. We believe 10 percent discount justified. This results in 12 month share price target of 37.00 guilders.</p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	pvs	P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1995 (actual)	1.46   (1.11)     21.3    0.51</p>
<p>    1996		   1.84		  16.8    0.64</p>
<p>    1997		   2.23		  13.9    0.78</p>
